1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,300
This little rabbit started as an image.

2
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:07,250
I wanted to see it take its first steps.

3
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:10,800
But something didn't feel quite right.

4
00:00:11,650 --> 00:00:13,600
So I kept changing little things...

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,700
until it felt like itself.

6
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:19,400
A softer face. A tiny nose.

7
00:00:20,650 --> 00:00:23,900
And suddenly... it started to feel alive.

8
00:00:25,450 --> 00:00:28,650
Now it has a little world to explore.
